          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Servo Tool Magazine</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">Fast and reliable servo-driven tool change minimizes non-cutting time in production cycles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
