            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">Stable machine structure delivers repeatable results across long production runs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1.2rem;text-align:right;">设备亮点</h2>
